step Elixir of Minor Fortitude to 92
  tip Elixir of Minor Fortitude is orange at 75 (yellow 80, green 100, grey 120): about 20 crafts to 92, up to 23 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Earthroot, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial. Two Earthroot and a Peacebloom a craft, herbs of the starting zones and the 10-20 zones; orange to 80.
  craft 2334 until 92

step Alchemy recipes at 92
  tip Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Wisdom (from 90).
  learn 3171

step Elixir of Wisdom to 135
  tip Elixir of Wisdom is orange at 92 (yellow 120, green 140, grey 160): about 47 crafts to 135, up to 50 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Mageroyal, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Empty Vial. Two Briarthorn and a Mageroyal a craft, both from the 10-25 zones; orange to 120.
  craft 3171 until 135

step Alchemy recipes at 135
  tip Back to an Alchemy trainer: Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir (from 125).
  learn 3176

step Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir to 150
  tip Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir is orange at 135 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 15 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Two Bruiseweed and two Briarthorn a craft; Bruiseweed grows in the 15-30 zones. Alchemy 150 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 3176 until 150
  skill Alchemy 150

