step Expert Alchemy
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Ainethil (Darnassus); Horde Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity). This route trains it at Ainethil (Darnassus) for the Alliance and Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 45 Wild Steelbloom, 42 Kingsblood, 42 Stranglekelp and 45 Goldthorn to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Mana Potion (from 160) and Elixir of Defense (from 195), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
  level 20
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4160 only Alliance
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4611 only Horde

step Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir to 160
  tip Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 12 crafts to 160, up to 14 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Two Bruiseweed and two Briarthorn a craft; Bruiseweed grows in the 15-30 zones. If you got here without learning Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 3176
  craft 3176 until 160

step Alchemy recipes at 160
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Mana Potion (from 160).
  learn 3452 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 3452 npc 4611 only Horde

step Mana Potion to 195
  tip Mana Potion is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195, up to 42 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Stranglekelp, 1 Kingsblood and 1 Leaded Vial. Stranglekelp grows under water along the coasts: bring a water breathing elixir or come up for air. Kingsblood grows in the 20-40 zones.
  craft 3452 until 195

step Alchemy recipes at 195
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Elixir of Defense (from 195).
  learn 11450 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 11450 npc 4611 only Horde

step Elixir of Defense to 225
  tip Elixir of Defense is orange at 195 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 32 crafts to 225, up to 34 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands). Alchemy 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 11450 until 225
  skill Alchemy 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Alchemy 225-300

step Alchemy 225-300: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 51 Leaded Vial (20s 40c) and 86 Crystal Vial (4g 30s); about 4g 50s 40c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3372 x51 nearest
  buy 8925 x86 nearest

step Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense
  tip Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense teaches Elixir of Greater Defense (Alchemy 265) for 1g 30s. Sold by Alliance: Soolie Berryfizz (Ironforge), limited stock; Horde: Kor'geld (Orgrimmar), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 13478 nearest

step Get Purple Lotus
  tip 144 Purple Lotus for Alchemy 225-300: 48 Dreamless Sleep Potions. Herbalism: Purple Lotus (skill 210) in The Hinterlands (40-50), Feralas (40-50) and Azshara (45-55). The window lists the Herbalism areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them. Or buy them at the Auction House.
