step Get Stonescale Eel
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip 48 Stonescale Eel for Alchemy 225-300: 48 Elixirs of Greater Defense. Fish them from the Stonescale Eel Swarm pools at the marked spot. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 13422 x48 @27.5,76.5 era gather Fishing 225
  auction 13422 x48

step Artisan Alchemy
  zone Azeroth
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kylanna Windwhisper (Feralas) and Master Mycologist Shurome (Felwood); Horde Master Mycologist Shurome (Felwood) and Rogvar (Swamp of Sorrows). This route trains it at Kylanna Windwhisper (Feralas) for the Alliance and Rogvar (Swamp of Sorrows) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 225-300: one trainer for every visit. 225-300 takes about 1g 30s of recipes and 4g 50s 40c of vendor goods, plus 144 Purple Lotus, 48 Sungrass and 48 Stonescale Eel to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Dreamless Sleep Potion (from 230) and Stonescale Oil (from 250), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
  level 35
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 7948 only Alliance
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 1386 only Horde

step Elixir of Defense to 230
  tip Elixir of Defense is yellow at 225 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 8 crafts to 230, up to 11 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands). If you got here without learning Elixir of Defense, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 11450 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 11450 npc 4611 only Horde
  craft 11450 until 230

step Alchemy recipes at 230
  tip Still at the Artisan trainer: Dreamless Sleep Potion (from 230).
  learn 15833 npc 7948 only Alliance
  learn 15833 npc 1386 only Horde

step Dreamless Sleep Potion to 265
  tip Dreamless Sleep Potion is orange at 230 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 43 crafts to 265, up to 48 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 3 Purple Lotus and 1 Crystal Vial. Three Purple Lotus a craft (Herbalism 210: the Hinterlands and Feralas, mobs of level 44-47) and a Crystal Vial from an alchemy vendor. The Herbalism guide's areas there give Sungrass for the last stretch too.
  craft 15833 until 265

step Alchemy recipes at 265
  tip Still at the Artisan trainer: Stonescale Oil (from 250).
  learn 17551 npc 7948 only Alliance
  learn 17551 npc 1386 only Horde

step Elixir of Greater Defense to 300
  tip Elixir of Greater Defense is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300, up to 48 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass and 1 Crystal Vial. Make the 86 Stonescale Oil (43 crafts) first. Stonescale Eel comes from the Stonescale Eel schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 17554 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 17551 x43
  craft 17554 until 300
  skill Alchemy 300
